bluejetty:00022833:ios.description:
Repair any kind of damage in your photos: scratches, rips, cuts, stains. Rebuild missing parts with the Replicator tool. Erase any unwanted object or text. 
This app is the ultimate professional tool, packed with advanced powerful algorithms, able to bring your damaged photos back to their original condition. 
The way it works is really simple: For a quick fix just set the image you want to fix and, automatically, the app will do it for you. Otherwise If you are an user who wants even better results and precision you can follow the entire process manually.
10 PROFESSIONAL TOOLS ABLE TO:
- Colorize black and white photos;
- Increase quality and faces resolution;
- Remove cuts and rips from photos;
- Rebuild missing parts;
- Remove scratches, marks and stains;
- Repair old photos which got damaged over time;
- Remove imperfections from any image;
- Hide text or objects from any image;
- Smoothen areas and create a depth of field effect;
- Dehaze foggy and faded images;
PACKED WITH:
- Simple and intuitive interface;
- High precision mode (A magnifier shows you where you are editing);
- Advanced AI Machine Learning algorithms;
EASY TO USE:
The app provides several in-app tutorials to help you learn how to use it correctly.
YOU WILL NOT NEED ANYTHING ELSE!
This app packs all the tools needed to fix your damaged photos from any kind of degradation!
Please be aware that this is a professional tool, follow the in-app explanation in order to learn how to use it correctly.
The app requires a subscription in order to use some premium tools.
For more information you can send an email to info@genovasoftworks.com or visit www.genovasoftworks.com.
Terms and Privacy Policy available at https://www.genovasoftworks.com/terms.php.

